000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TQTCREAT.
000400 AUTHOR.         BARBARA WINTER.
000500*INSTALLATION.   GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER COMPANY.
000600 DATE-WRITTEN.   APRIL 1987.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.
001000*D   MAIN PROGRAM FOR QUOTE CREATE PROGRAM; OPENS ALL FILES.
001100 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001200 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001300 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
001400 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    HP-3000.
001500 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT MPLTINFO
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
005700 DATA DIVISION.
005800 FILE SECTION.
       FD  MPLTINFO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.
001600
001900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS1             PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS2             PIC X.
002000 01  ERROR-CODE                   PIC -9999.
002100 01  PASS-SPOOL                   PIC S9(2) VALUE ZEROES COMP-4.
002200
002300 COPY TSPLPRT OF COPYCSIS.
003100*------ TBLOWUP (PRINTS ERRORS TO AN ERROR FILE "BLOWUP.PUB" AND)
003200*------ (ABORTS PROGRAM.  RUN XBLPRT.OBJECT TO READ ERRORS.)
003300 01  BU-DISPLAY-MSG               PIC X(60) VALUE SPACES.
003400 01  BU-PGM-NAME                  PIC X(8)  VALUE "TQTCREAT".
003500 01  BU-DISPLAY-AREA              PIC X(110) VALUE ALL "0".
003600 01  BU-DISPLAY-FLDS REDEFINES BU-DISPLAY-AREA.
003700     05  BU-DISPLAY-LINE OCCURS 5 TIMES.
003800         10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD       PIC X(14).
003900         10  BU-DISPLAY-FLD9      PIC S9(8).
004000 01  KSAM-STATUS                  PIC X(2)    VALUE "00".
004100
004200*************************************************************
004300*                D A T A B A S E   V A R I A B L E S        *
004400*************************************************************
004600 01  BASE                         PIC X(10) VALUE "  STORES;".
004800
005300 01  MPLTINFO-ARG                 PIC X(4)  VALUE SPACES.
005400 01  PASS-QUOTE-PRT               PIC 9(2)  COMP-4 VALUE ZEROS.
005500
005600*----------  STATUS AREA
005700 01  STATUS-AREA.
005800     05  COND-WORD                PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
005900         88  GOOD-CALL                              VALUE 0.
006000         88  END-OF-FILE                            VALUE 11.
006100         88  START-OF-CHAIN                         VALUE 14.
006200         88  END-OF-CHAIN                           VALUE 15.
006300         88  NO-ENTRY                               VALUE 17.
006400     05  DATA-LENG                PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
006500     05  RCD-NO                   PIC S9(9) COMP-4.
006600     05  CHAIN-LENG               PIC S9(9) COMP-4.
006700     05  BKWD-ADDR                PIC S9(9) COMP-4.
006800     05  FWRD-ADDR                PIC S9(9) COMP-4.
006900
007300 COPY MPLTINFO OF COPYCSIS.
007400 COPY VCOMAREA OF COPYCSIS.
007500
007600 01  FORMFILE.
007700     05  FORM-FNAME               PIC X(7)  VALUE "FQUOTES".
007800     05  FILLER                   PIC X     VALUE ".".
007900     05  FORM-GNAME.
008000         10  FORM-GNAME1          PIC X(5)  VALUE "FLANG".
008100         10  FORM-GNAME2          PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
008200     05  FILLER                   PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.
008300*----------  NATIVE LANGUAGE SUPPORT AREA
008400 COPY LANGUAGE OF COPYCSIS.
008500
008600**************************************************************
008700*        P R O C E D U R E        D I V I S I O N            *
008800**************************************************************
008900 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
009000 00-MAIN.
009100     PERFORM 010-OPEN-ALL THRU 019-EXIT.
009200
009300     CALL "SQTCREAT" USING BASE, VIEW-COMAREA, FORMFILE,
009400                 LANGUAGE-PARMS, PASS-SPOOL, PASS-QUOTE-PRT.
009500
009600     PERFORM 020-CLOSE-ALL THRU 029-EXIT.
009700
009800     GOBACK.
009900****************************************************************
010000*           OPEN ALL FILES AND PREPARE FOR PROCESSING          *
010100****************************************************************
010200 010-OPEN-ALL.
013100
013200*----------  OPEN DATABASE
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO.
013800
013900     CALL "TSPLPRT" USING SP-RET-CODE, SP-AREA.
014000     IF SP-RET-CODE = "NF"
014100         MOVE "SPOOL KEY NOT FOUND * TQTCREAT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
014200         PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT
014300     ELSE
014400     IF SP-RET-CODE NOT = "00"
014500         MOVE "TSPLPRT ERROR * TQTCREAT" TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
014600         PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
014700
014800     MOVE SP-SPOOL-NO (1)                 TO  PASS-SPOOL.
014900*----------  FIND QUOTE PRINTER
015000     MOVE "POPT"                          TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO   INTO BUF-MPLTINFO INVALID KEY
                MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD.
034160     IF COND-WORD NOT = 0
034170           MOVE "DBGET MPLTINFO2 - TUDCQUOT " TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
034180           PERFORM 990-BLOWUP THRU 999-EXIT.
028000     MOVE MPLTINFO-QUOTE-PRT-NO           TO PASS-QUOTE-PRT.
015400 019-EXIT.  EXIT.
015500
015600****************************************************************
015700*                    CLOSE ALL FILES                           *
015800****************************************************************
015900 020-CLOSE-ALL.
016000     CLOSE MPLTINFO.
016400 029-EXIT.  EXIT.
016500************************************************************
016600*                    B L O W U P                           *
016700*     CHECK FOR IMAGE, VIEW, OR SPOOL ERROR.  CLOSE        *
016800*     FILES, GET OUT OF BLOCK MODE, AND DISPLAY            *
016900*     APPROPRIATE ERROR MESSAGE ON SCREEN.                 *
017000*                                                          *
017100*     ALSO APPENDS THE ERROR MESSAGE TO A FILE CALLED      *
017200*     BLOWUP.PUB.  TO READ THIS FILE, RUN "XBLPRT.OBJECT". *
017300*                                                          *
017400*         |||  PROGRAM IS ABORTED IN TBLOWUP  |||          *
017500************************************************************
017600 990-BLOWUP.
017700*----------  PURGE THE FILE
017800     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
017900           VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
018000           BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.
018100 999-EXIT.  EXIT.
